e711924/4e782d50-52d0-11f1-9482-3120031649b2/file-6y3zli1mpbdipwm.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p> The compound <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.408ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 4158.6 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1505,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1908.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1472,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is an aliphatic aldehyde because it has the aldehyde group <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.975ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 3967 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(389,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate